This is a collection of Prototype Oriented Programming libraries for Lua 5.1
(including LuaJIT), 5.2, 5.3, 5.4 and 5.5. The libraries are copyright by their
authors (see the AUTHORS file for details), and released under the MIT license
(the same license as Lua itself). There is no warranty.

prototype has no run-time prerequisites beyond a standard Lua system, though it
will take advantage of stdlib, strict and typecheck if they are installed.
